00:18:09.230 --> 00:18:10.560
<i>All units, aim for the Gundam!</i>

00:18:16.570 --> 00:18:17.990
Surround the Gundam!

00:18:22.450 --> 00:18:24.330
<i>Everyone, stop their attack!</i>

00:18:27.660 --> 00:18:29.330
Hurry! Hurry!

00:18:29.540 --> 00:18:31.500
Gundam... are you ready yet?

00:18:32.540 --> 00:18:33.960
A little more...!

00:18:35.380 --> 00:18:37.090
Just a little more...!

00:18:38.720 --> 00:18:39.720
What's wrong, Kio?

00:18:40.340 --> 00:18:41.140
That's right!

00:18:47.390 --> 00:18:48.560
There!

00:18:53.730 --> 00:18:55.360
Kio! What are you doing?!

00:18:55.780 --> 00:18:57.030
If I'm firing it anyway...!

00:18:59.490 --> 00:19:00.490
Impossible!

00:19:40.490 --> 00:19:41.740
You did it, Kio!

00:19:47.160 --> 00:19:48.080
Withdraw!

00:20:05.600 --> 00:20:09.470
The AGE system made an amazing weapon.

00:20:10.770 --> 00:20:14.400
But it won't be easy to use.

00:20:15.900 --> 00:20:17.070
Former Commander-in-Chief Asuno.

00:20:18.230 --> 00:20:20.860
I'm team leader Seric Abis.

00:20:21.700 --> 00:20:23.990
Take care of the rest.

00:20:25.910 --> 00:20:26.910
You did well.

00:20:28.200 --> 00:20:29.700
Thank you very much!

00:20:29.700 --> 00:20:30.620
Hey.

00:20:32.080 --> 00:20:34.830
Why did you fly out of our formation?

00:20:36.040 --> 00:20:38.000
I wasn't sure we could protect you.

00:20:42.510 --> 00:20:44.590
Don't throw your life away, okay?

00:20:44.590 --> 00:20:45.970
This isn't a game.

00:20:48.310 --> 00:20:49.140
Yes, ma'am.

00:20:53.230 --> 00:20:54.640
Um...

00:20:55.100 --> 00:20:58.570
I-I'm the captain, Natora Einus.

00:21:00.480 --> 00:21:05.660
The ship will be continuing on to 
Rostroulan, our new command center.

00:21:06.280 --> 00:21:07.200
I see.

00:21:07.200 --> 00:21:08.740
I'm so sorry!

00:21:10.790 --> 00:21:13.620
Someone who can't make use of a ship's full capabilities,

00:21:13.620 --> 00:21:15.580
has no right to be captain.

00:21:17.000 --> 00:21:22.800
Remember this, the captain is responsible for the lives of everyone on the ship.

00:21:28.350 --> 00:21:29.260
Yes, sir.

00:21:38.940 --> 00:21:39.810
Kio.

00:21:40.820 --> 00:21:42.070
Grandpa.

00:21:42.980 --> 00:21:46.110
Can you believe in the Gundam?

00:21:46.950 --> 00:21:48.110
Yes.

00:21:48.410 --> 00:21:51.790
The Gundam responded when I piloted.{piloting}

00:21:52.870 --> 00:21:53.870
Hey, Grandpa...

00:21:54.870 --> 00:21:57.960
Ezelcant is the leader of Vagan, right?

00:21:57.960 --> 00:21:59.040
Yes.

00:21:59.040 --> 00:22:03.170
He's an evil being. A demon{king/lord} who seeks to destroy humanity.{You wouldn't call someone a "demon lord" in English}

00:22:03.170 --> 00:22:04.880
He must be defeated, no matter what.

00:22:13.180 --> 00:22:15.180
I'll defeat him.

00:22:16.480 --> 00:22:20.020
If that's what the Vagan are like, I'll defeat them!

00:22:20.020 --> 00:22:23.780
With your Gundam, Grandpa...

